{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bye! bye, okay, bye, take care, please, take care","G-go safe, go safe, you're in my prayers, you are","Goodbye, I hope we see each other again, I really, really hope","See you around- I mean, I hope so, I'd like that","Be careful -- be so careful, don't take any chances, promise me!","Okay, bye, bye, goodbye, thank you for talking to me, it helped"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bye, then, hope I see you again","Safe travels, friend, don't take unnecessary risks","So long... try not to die out there","Until next time, if there is a next time","Bye now, take it slow","Go well, and if you find anything good, come tell me"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come back soon, will you? I'll miss you","Bye now!! Come see us again, hear?","Safe journey, and may we meet again, soon, in better times","Go, go, but come back, come back and tell me you're alright"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Good, leave","Go on, get out of HERE","Goodbye, and don't come back","Finally, take care, I guess, from a distance!","Leave!","Finally","Go, I'll watch you leave","Bye, and I mean it, don't turn around","Go on, I'm keeping my eyes on you until you're out of sight"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"Get home before dark, or find a place to hole up, please","Go safe, and be inside by sundown, it's getting late","Get inside soon","Take care"},false,false,{[3]={{t="it's getting late",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="find a roof before dark",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Take care after dark. Don't count on nobody noticing a fire","Good night, if there's such a thing, sleep light","See ya, and quiet out there","Go, and don't light a thing","Sleep tight, if you can"},false,false,{[3]={{t="and good night, if there is such a thing",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="the dark is your friend, tonight",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,10",{"Have a good day, if that's possible, stay alive until noon, at least","Morning's the best time to travel, good luck","Have a good day","Go safe"},false,false,{[3]={{t="a quiet one",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="the morning is yours",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"FAREWELL","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Go with God, go in peace, and come back anytime","God go with you, and bring you back","Walk gently","Go in peace, and may the Lord keep you","Come back whenever you like, child, we'll always have room","Go with God, and go around Rosewood, if you can help it"},false,false,{[2]={{t="safely, and soon",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="and don't forget to eat",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FAREWELL","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Go on then, and don't get shot","Safe travels","Stay sharp","Take care, neighbor, we've got your back out here","Go safe, and spread the word we're friendly"},false,false,{[2]={{t="keep your head on a swivel",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="and watch your six",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FAREWELL","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Get that cough looked at, and wash your hands, would you","Wash up and drink water, you hear? Come back if it gets worse","Go gently, and if you feel a fever coming, find someone, don't hide it","Take care of those wounds, change the dressing tomorrow, and drink water","Come back if it gets worse, don't be stubborn","Goodbye - clean anything that breaks the skin - anything, even a thorn"}},
{"FAREWELL","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Watch for smoke out there, it's always smoke first","Stay safe out there","Be careful","Watch for gas leaks out there, and everything else too","Take care, friend, and if you see smoke, run toward the nearest door","Take care, and stay out of anything with smoke coming out of it"},false,false,{[2]={{t="and stay low",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="the world's flammable",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FAREWELL","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Go on, then, dear, mind your steps, and eat something","Go with God, dear...","Bye now","Go with God, child, and wrap up warm, you hear?","Goodbye, dear, come back and see an old woman sometime","Go on, then, keep your feet dry and your head down"},false,false,{[2]={{t="and don't forget your hat",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="mind the road, and say a prayer",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"FAREWELL","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Goodbye, and keep your germs to yourself"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Go safe, go safe, and come back, will you? please come back","Take care of yourself, okay? Folks'd miss you","Bye -- bye, friend, I'll be thinking of you, I'll light a candle!!","Be careful out there, there's not many like you left","Come back soon, there's a seat, a story, maybe a biscuit waiting","Stay alive, that's all I ask, stay alive, and come see me","Goodbye, my friend, may the road be kind to you, heh","Don't be a stranger, you hear me? come visit","Bye now, thank you for everything, really, everything","Take care, and tell me how it goes, if you can","May God watch over you, and may we meet again soon","Go on, go, and keep an eye on your back","I'll miss you, you know that? I'll miss you, truly","Come back and see us, you hear?","You're always welcome here, don't forget that","Goodbye for now, not forever, just for now","Stay strong, friend, I'm rooting for you!!","Bye now, and thanks for stopping, it meant something","Go with my blessing, and my gratitude!","See you soon, I hope, I really hope, see you soon!","Take care, and if you need anything, anything at all, you know where to find me","Safe travels, hope it goes easy","Until next time, friend, until next time","Don't forget us, we won't forget you","Go gently, and come home safe!","Don't get in trouble, and if you do, come find me","Bye now, look after yourself, you're one of the good ones","Be careful, please... I mean it, be careful","I'll keep a light on for you -- as long as I can!","Goodbye, my friend, thanks for talking, it helped more than you know"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Finally, goodbye","Go on -- get out, and don't come back!!","About time you left","Good riddance","Leave, and take your reputation with you","Don't let the door hit you on the way out","Goodbye, and I mean it","Stay away from us, understand?","I'll be glad to see your back!","Get lost, and stay lost","Go, and keep going!","Bye -- and don't bother writing!","Off you go, and don't look back","Move along, you're not welcome here","See you, never, hopefully","Go, just go","Don't come back, I mean it","Yeah, yeah, goodbye, now go","Take your troubles elsewhere","Out, out, out","Fine, leave, I won't miss you!","Don't stop on my account","I won't say it was nice meeting you","Go find somebody else to bother","Keep walking, and keep your distance","Goodbye -- and good luck, you'll need it","Away with you, go on","Leave while you still can","Shoo, go on, get","That's right, walk away"}},
{"FAREWELL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Go, go, quietly, they're coming, go now!!","Bye... bye, stay low, don't run until you must!","Get out of here, I'll cover- I'll hide, just go","Goodbye, quick, quick, before they notice","Go on, GO, stay safe, don't look back","Go on, quietly now, take care","Go, go, go, take the back way, don't stop","Bye, and be careful, they're close, so close","Quickly now, and God keep you","Move, move, before they come around the corner"}},
